      "imageAt": [
        0,
        0.4
      ],
      "seconds": 20.2,
      "text": "This is not carelessness. It is the design working. Your senses take in far more than your brain can process, so attention acts as a budget, and anything outside the task gets spent down to nothing. The unsettling part is the second finding. The people who missed it were completely certain nothing had been there. The deletion leaves no receipt.",
